@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
title Adding a partial contact: successful execution

participant ":LogicManager" as LogicManager LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":AddCommand" as AddCommand LOGIC_COLOR
participant ":Model" as Model MODEL_COLOR
participant ":Storage" as Storage STORAGE_COLOR

[-> LogicManager : execute("add --name Alice")
activate LogicManager
ref over LogicManager, AddCommand
AddressBookParser and AddCommandParser
validate input and create AddCommand(p).
end ref
note over AddCommand
p has the required name.
Omitted phone, email and address use notProvided().
Department is absent and the tag set is empty.
end note

LogicManager -> AddCommand : execute(model)
activate AddCommand
AddCommand -> Model : hasPerson(p)
activate Model
Model --> AddCommand : false
deactivate Model
AddCommand -> Model : addPerson(p)
activate Model
note over Model
Add p to the address book;
refresh the display to show all contacts.
end note
Model --> AddCommand
deactivate Model
AddCommand --> LogicManager : result: CommandResult(feedback)
deactivate AddCommand

LogicManager -> AddCommand : requiresStorageSave()
activate AddCommand
AddCommand --> LogicManager : true
deactivate AddCommand
LogicManager -> Model : getAddressBook()
activate Model
Model --> LogicManager : addressBook
deactivate Model
LogicManager -> Storage : saveAddressBook(addressBook)
activate Storage
note over Storage
JsonAdaptedPerson serializes missing
phone, email and address as empty strings.
end note
Storage --> LogicManager : saved successfully
deactivate Storage
[<-- LogicManager : result
deactivate LogicManager

note over LogicManager
The UI displays the addition feedback:
missing details are Not provided; no tags is None.
end note
@enduml
